  "name": "Variability in Bering Sea Ice Cover as Affected by a Regime Shift in the North Pacific in the period 1947-1996",
  "description": "Published article in Journal of Geophysical Research. Includes monthly mean time series air and sea temperatures, winds, and sea ice coverage for the Bering Sea.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The data were developed to document fluctuations in the physical environment of the Eastern Bering Sea on time scales of months to decades.",
